---
---
<section class="conoce wrap" id="conoce">
  <div class="grid">
    <div>
      <span class="pill" style="--c:var(--pimienta)">Conocé Kichar</span>
      <h2 class="disp split" style="margin-top:18px">Carne posta, versión snack</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top:22px">
        Durante generaciones, la carne deshidratada fue la forma de conservar los alimentos.
        Recuperamos esa idea y la llevamos al presente: un snack cárnico para una vida activa.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pila">
      <svg class="aro-svg" viewBox="0 0 600 360" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="dibujar"
          d="M40 230 C 20 140, 200 60, 340 64 C 500 68, 590 140, 566 210 C 540 290, 360 320, 240 312 C 120 304, 44 280, 40 230 C 38 200, 80 160, 150 132"
          stroke="#141210" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
      <img src="/img/pila.webp" alt="Pila de carne deshidratada Kichar" />

      <svg class="flechas" viewBox="0 0 560 520" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <marker id="arr" markerWidth="14" markerHeight="14" refX="9" refY="7" orient="auto">
            <path d="M1,1 L12,7 L1,13" fill="none" stroke="#141210" stroke-width="2.5"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <!-- attr-1 top-left → carne -->
        <path d="M 152 88 C 182 138, 218 184, 240 224"
          stroke="#141210" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>
        <!-- attr-2 top-right → carne -->
        <path d="M 408 88 C 378 138, 342 184, 320 224"
          stroke="#141210" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>
        <!-- attr-3 bottom → carne -->
        <path d="M 280 440 C 280 408, 280 362, 280 304"
          stroke="#141210" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>
      </svg>

      <div class="attr attr-1">
        <b>Carne de pastura</b>
        <span>Cortes magros, sin rellenos.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="attr attr-2">
        <b>Sidra + sal</b>
        <span>Vinagre de manzana y sal. Nada más.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="attr attr-3">
        <b>Secado lento</b>
        <span>Sin azúcar ni conservantes.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.conoce {
  position: relative;
  padding-block: 120px 140px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.conoce .grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.conoce .split .w {
  display: inline-block;
  opacity: .18;
}

.conoce .pila {
  position: relative;
  height: 520px;
}

.conoce .pila img {
  position: absolute;
  width: 60%;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  translate: -50% -50%;
  will-change: transform;
}

.aro-svg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: -6% -4%;
  width: 108%;
  height: 112%;
}

.flechas {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 2;
}

.attr {
  position: absolute;
  background: var(--crema);
  border: 2.5px solid var(--tinta);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  max-width: 148px;
  z-index: 5;
  will-change: transform;
}

.attr b {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-weight: 400;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: .88rem;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.attr span {
  font-size: .76rem;
  color: var(--tinta-2);
  display: block;
  margin-top: 3px;
}

.attr-1 { top: 5%;    left: 0; }
.attr-2 { top: 5%;    right: 0; }
.attr-3 { bottom: 5%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }

@media (max-width: 820px) {
  .conoce .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .conoce .pila { height: 380px; }
  .attr { max-width: 120px; }
  .attr b { font-size: .8rem; }
  .attr span { font-size: .7rem; }
  .flechas { opacity: .7; }
}
</style>
